WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.440
EPISODE 30

01:57.600 --> 01:59.960
The new son-in-law visits his in-laws.

02:00.040 --> 02:02.400
As tradition,
he must serve tea to the elders.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.440
Please.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.960
Easy tests. I've got it.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.160
Madam, please.

02:24.240 --> 02:25.160
Mom.

02:25.760 --> 02:28.320
He's seven or eight days late.

02:28.400 --> 02:30.360
The Yang family
must've brought lavish gifts.

02:31.040 --> 02:33.040
Why don't we take a look first?

02:34.560 --> 02:35.560
Okay.

02:37.040 --> 02:37.880
Qiansheng.

02:38.560 --> 02:39.560
Sure.

02:51.040 --> 02:52.160
Quite thoughtful.

02:54.960 --> 02:56.000
Take them.

03:03.880 --> 03:04.920
Mom.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.360
Have some tea.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.680
Get up.

03:37.720 --> 03:39.440
Mom.

04:04.720 --> 04:07.360
I was naive and arrogant in my youth.

04:08.120 --> 04:09.680
I was misled by others,

04:09.760 --> 04:11.360
which led to foolish mistakes.

04:12.320 --> 04:15.680
Thanks to your forgiveness,
I married Leshan.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.680
Since our marriage,

04:17.760 --> 04:19.960
my wife has guided me tirelessly.

04:20.040 --> 04:22.080
I've reflected on my past mistakes.

04:22.160 --> 04:24.840
I vow to turn over a new leaf
and leave my faults behind.

04:26.000 --> 04:28.280
I hope everyone here

04:28.360 --> 04:31.600
can forgive me. I'm truly grateful.

04:34.880 --> 04:36.440
It's not late, not late at all!

04:37.760 --> 04:39.600
It's good that you've changed.

04:39.680 --> 04:42.160
Who hasn't made mistakes in their youth?

04:43.160 --> 04:45.360
But what if they disagree?

04:48.920 --> 04:50.320
You're from a rich family,

04:50.400 --> 04:52.120
- and you're young
- Mom.

04:52.200 --> 04:55.600
- and easily misled by other evils.
- Sit down.

04:55.680 --> 04:58.280
- But he regrets his mistakes now.
- I really miss you.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.400
That's good.

05:00.200 --> 05:03.200
We're family. There's no room for grudges.

05:03.840 --> 05:05.280
Right, my lord?

05:07.080 --> 05:09.120
My wife is right. Absolutely.

05:09.200 --> 05:10.280
He…

05:16.000 --> 05:17.040
Thank you, Madam.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.920
Something feels off to me.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.240
You better sort this out.

05:25.080 --> 05:27.160
What's that burnt smell?

05:29.280 --> 05:31.000
I've got pork simmering on the stove.

05:31.080 --> 05:33.800
Yang Xian, I am cooking today. Try it.

05:33.880 --> 05:35.480
- You all sit with him.
- Thanks, Madam.

05:36.200 --> 05:37.280
We'll join you.

05:38.920 --> 05:40.000
Let's go too.

05:40.080 --> 05:40.920
- And me.
- The soup.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.520
Kangning makes it the best.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.360
It's rare to have such a guest.

05:44.960 --> 05:46.480
We need your help.

05:46.560 --> 05:48.960
- Let's go.
- Kangning, just go.

05:49.680 --> 05:51.640
Yang Xian, excuse us for a moment.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.280
Of course.

05:57.800 --> 05:58.960
Wait…

06:08.120 --> 06:09.280
Good luck.

06:16.640 --> 06:18.280
- Yuanming.
- Chai.

06:26.520 --> 06:29.040
Leshan, tell me the truth.

06:29.120 --> 06:31.440
Are you conspiring with him to fool Mom?

06:31.520 --> 06:32.640
Change?

06:32.720 --> 06:33.840
He'll never change.

06:33.920 --> 06:35.520
Not even if pigs climb trees.

06:37.720 --> 06:39.480
That's nonsense.

06:39.560 --> 06:41.240
Fuhui tamed her husband.

06:41.320 --> 06:42.640
Why can't I do the same?

06:44.280 --> 06:45.440
Kangning,

06:45.520 --> 06:47.120
you underestimate me.

06:48.320 --> 06:49.880
What are they up to?

06:50.680 --> 06:53.280
You're new here,
so you don't know our family rules.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.400
It's not hard to marry into the Li family.

06:55.480 --> 06:56.920
First, remember three things.

06:57.520 --> 07:00.240
The first, when your wife is upset…

07:00.840 --> 07:02.000
You must soothe her.

07:02.080 --> 07:03.960
- What about scolding from Madam?
- Endure it.

07:04.040 --> 07:06.880
My wife reminded me many times.
I won't forget.

07:06.960 --> 07:10.720
Did she tell you
before joining the Li Family,

07:10.800 --> 07:13.160
you should first pass the tests
from us, the brothers-in-law?

07:15.560 --> 07:16.560
What kind of tests?

07:16.640 --> 07:17.960
Yuanming.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.840
Back when we chose a husband for her,

07:20.920 --> 07:22.960
we followed our wives' orders.

07:23.560 --> 07:25.920
We searched the entire capital
for the best talents.

07:26.000 --> 07:28.000
No one dared approach Li's house

07:28.080 --> 07:30.160
without exceptional skills.

07:30.760 --> 07:35.040
Today, I see you handsome and charming.

07:35.120 --> 07:38.800
His look matches with Leshan.

07:38.880 --> 07:41.000
But to know how he matches her
on the talents,

07:41.080 --> 07:43.960
it will depend on your learnings.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.800
- Lord Shen.
- Don't look at me.

07:46.880 --> 07:49.680
Outside, I have some authority,

07:49.760 --> 07:50.800
but in this house,

07:50.880 --> 07:53.160
my wife is the fourth sister.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.640
She's one of the younger ones.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.680
Even if I'd like to help you,

07:56.760 --> 07:58.040
I don't have a say here.

07:58.120 --> 07:59.680
Master Yang,

07:59.760 --> 08:02.280
you can only rely on yourself.

08:04.400 --> 08:05.440
Stop it!

08:07.320 --> 08:08.640
Take a break. Don't move.

08:09.240 --> 08:10.080
What kind of test?

08:10.160 --> 08:11.240
Yuanming.

08:12.920 --> 08:14.720
A martial challenge?

08:15.520 --> 08:16.760
We know you're not skilled.

08:16.840 --> 08:19.440
- So, let's test academics.
- Yeah.

08:20.160 --> 08:22.600
Instruments, chess, calligraphy,
and painting. Pick one.

08:22.680 --> 08:25.000
Show us what you're good at.

08:25.600 --> 08:26.760
Master Yang,

08:27.400 --> 08:29.360
if it's decent,

08:29.440 --> 08:31.520
we'll accept you.

08:32.680 --> 08:35.400
Old grudges will be forgotten.

08:36.560 --> 08:38.320
But if you fail,

08:38.920 --> 08:40.840
don't blame us for being harsh.

08:44.720 --> 08:47.200
Give him a tough lesson,

08:47.280 --> 08:49.320
so he knows the Li family isn't easy.

08:49.400 --> 08:51.120
Being a Li son-in-law is even harder.

08:52.520 --> 08:54.760
- I should check on them.
- Where to?

08:55.520 --> 08:57.880
Stay out of it. It's men's business.

08:59.200 --> 09:01.080
Oh no!

09:01.160 --> 09:03.360
I forgot how tricky
my brothers-in-law are.

09:09.640 --> 09:12.400
I studied painting in my youth.

09:13.080 --> 09:16.120
Though not as skilled as Mr. Du,

09:16.720 --> 09:17.880
my strokes are decent.

09:18.640 --> 09:19.480
Do it.

09:20.080 --> 09:21.120
Excuse me.

09:29.640 --> 09:32.080
Too much ink bleeds the lines.
Haven't you learned this?

09:33.200 --> 09:36.040
It's said, strength gives grace.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.440
Speed gives stiffness.

09:37.520 --> 09:38.400
Reflect on yourself.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.600
Don't defend your flaws.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.320
Tension creates vigor.

09:43.000 --> 09:46.920
Act recklessly
and there will be consequences.

09:48.160 --> 09:49.680
Straighten your back.

09:54.560 --> 09:55.720
The ink needs some water.

09:57.960 --> 10:00.040
Stay humble and self-aware.

10:00.960 --> 10:03.320
Aim high but avoid arrogance.

10:04.240 --> 10:07.080
Be grounded but ambitious.

10:07.160 --> 10:10.200
Face life with a calm smile.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.160
There.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.880
All done.

10:16.960 --> 10:20.040
After all that, your mouth must be dry.

10:34.280 --> 10:36.000
You outnumbered and bullied me.

10:36.080 --> 10:37.520
How shameful!

10:37.600 --> 10:38.560
Who can respect that?

10:39.680 --> 10:41.800
Cousin, he is not convinced
and speaks of bullying.

10:41.880 --> 10:44.520
You oppressed others and forced marriage.

10:44.600 --> 10:45.880
Are you not shameful?

10:46.680 --> 10:47.840
If you say no,

10:47.920 --> 10:49.520
we will beat you until you agree.

10:49.600 --> 10:50.520
Count me in.

10:51.200 --> 10:52.320
- What are you doing?
- This…

10:52.400 --> 10:53.920
I told you not to act so rough.

10:54.000 --> 10:55.200
- It's disgraceful.
- Shameless.

10:55.280 --> 10:57.160
- This is too much!
- Enough, enough.

10:57.960 --> 10:58.920
Just a friendly spar.

10:59.520 --> 11:01.200
Stop!

11:03.520 --> 11:04.680
- Come back!
- Leshan.

11:11.560 --> 11:14.400
Stop!

11:15.200 --> 11:17.520
Dinner's ready.

11:20.520 --> 11:21.400
Mom. What?

11:21.480 --> 11:22.560
- Nothing.
- Nothing at all.

11:22.640 --> 11:23.640
Nothing.

11:26.800 --> 11:28.600
- Mom.
- Mom.

11:28.680 --> 11:30.640
Yang Xian wants duck.

11:30.720 --> 11:31.920
He's too shy to ask.

11:32.000 --> 11:34.000
I just finished the duck soup. Let me--

11:35.480 --> 11:38.520
I heard the two cooks
were borrowed from Pan Restaurant.

11:38.600 --> 11:40.360
Let's check if everything's set.

11:40.440 --> 11:42.240
- It's all ready.
- Mom.

11:43.520 --> 11:44.600
Wine-flavored snails?

11:46.200 --> 11:47.760
Didn't you just prepare some?

11:47.840 --> 11:49.480
You want that?

11:49.560 --> 11:50.840
Sure, I'll make them for you.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.760
Dear brothers-in-law,
stop fighting already.

12:01.840 --> 12:03.080
Enough is enough.

12:03.600 --> 12:05.400
Once he passes this test,

12:05.480 --> 12:07.080
he'll truly be one of us.

12:07.160 --> 12:08.760
I was wrong.

12:08.840 --> 12:11.640
Don't mess this up for me.

12:17.040 --> 12:18.760
Eat more. It's good for you.

12:21.760 --> 12:22.880
Here, wife.

12:22.960 --> 12:24.160
Put it there.

12:25.040 --> 12:26.320
- I want that.
- This one?

12:29.360 --> 12:31.800
Have some meat.

12:31.880 --> 12:33.560
A round face means good fortune.

12:35.720 --> 12:36.640
Shouhua,

12:36.720 --> 12:38.760
we should settle the match soon.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.760
We need time to prepare.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.240
Got it.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.560
Madam, Kangning loves me.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.960
This is my favorite.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.280
The acting might get a bit exaggerated.

13:05.360 --> 13:07.280
They'll give themselves away
before mother-in-law.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.320
Silly.

13:14.480 --> 13:16.360
My lord, here.

13:21.800 --> 13:22.760
- What?
- Look around.

13:26.000 --> 13:27.360
Is it good?

13:27.440 --> 13:28.320
- This.
- Sour?

13:28.400 --> 13:29.880
- Not bad.
- Try this.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.560
Take this.

13:32.640 --> 13:33.760
I'm full.

13:36.920 --> 13:39.320
My lady, have this.

13:40.600 --> 13:42.040
Yang Xian.

13:42.120 --> 13:44.960
This cured meat has orange peel and herbs.

13:45.040 --> 13:46.400
Leshan hates this flavor.

13:48.040 --> 13:50.880
My wife said she follows my lead now.

13:51.560 --> 13:53.280
Whatever I like, she likes too.

13:53.360 --> 13:56.520
She's even fixed her picky habits.

13:56.600 --> 13:59.960
That's what true harmony looks like.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.520
My wife loves it.

14:03.600 --> 14:05.720
It must be dipped in vinegar,

14:05.800 --> 14:08.000
then ginger and garlic.

14:08.520 --> 14:11.120
That's the best way. Try it.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.440
Take this.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.280
Thank you, my lord.

14:32.040 --> 14:32.880
Taste it.

14:39.520 --> 14:42.280
If you like it, have some more.

14:45.200 --> 14:48.600
Fan, I'm so sorry. It slipped. My mistake.

14:49.440 --> 14:50.400
I'm sorry.

14:53.800 --> 14:55.080
Alright, alright.

14:55.160 --> 14:57.680
You think I don't know
what mischief you're up to?

14:58.960 --> 15:00.840
Young rich boys

15:00.920 --> 15:03.760
always have bad friends.

15:03.840 --> 15:06.320
They always trick him into being evil.

15:06.400 --> 15:08.520
It's hard not to go astray.

15:09.280 --> 15:10.880
But if he were truly wicked,

15:10.960 --> 15:12.360
he'd never save others.

15:12.440 --> 15:15.200
Haode, Qiongnu,

15:15.280 --> 15:16.720
and the old lady.

15:17.320 --> 15:19.160
He saved all their lives.

15:19.760 --> 15:22.360
Marriage makes us family.

15:22.440 --> 15:24.880
No matter the past grudges,

15:24.960 --> 15:28.200
for that alone, he deserves a break.

15:28.960 --> 15:31.360
Let's not dwell on old wrongs.

15:31.440 --> 15:33.600
That's how family should be.

15:33.680 --> 15:36.240
Making peace to his face,
but scheming behind his back.

15:36.320 --> 15:38.240
Is that how the Li family acts?

15:42.680 --> 15:44.000
From birth till now,

15:44.080 --> 15:46.440
even my parents never said this to me.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.080
Madam, you're right.

15:50.160 --> 15:54.160
Since Yang Xian regrets his past,

15:54.240 --> 15:57.440
we should bury the hatchet.

15:57.520 --> 15:58.840
Get along well.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.520
All grudges aired,

16:01.040 --> 16:01.880
all anger gone.

16:02.480 --> 16:04.880
Let's drink to move on.

16:05.480 --> 16:07.280
- This one's on me.
- Me too.

16:07.360 --> 16:09.440
Thank you for saving my granny
and my wife.

16:09.520 --> 16:10.360
- Yuanming.
- Come.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.440
- Drink it.
- Drink it.

16:11.520 --> 16:13.120
- Yang Xian.
- And me.

16:13.200 --> 16:14.520
- Together.
- Drink this.

16:14.600 --> 16:15.640
- Drink one.
- Come on.

16:15.720 --> 16:16.560
- Madam.
- Mother.

16:16.640 --> 16:17.480
- Let's drink.
- Mother.

16:17.560 --> 16:18.640
Madam.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.640
- Here.
- I heard that.

16:19.720 --> 16:21.120
- Arrange a match for Qiongnu?
- Madam.

16:21.200 --> 16:22.800
- I'm going too.
- Yes.

16:22.880 --> 16:23.720
Mom.

16:23.800 --> 16:26.280
Don't make it too grand.

16:26.360 --> 16:29.240
You'll scare them off.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.120
I'll check on the food.

16:31.200 --> 16:33.960
It's a match, not a battle.

16:34.040 --> 16:34.880
- Madam.
- Mom.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.360
- Mom.
- Eat up.

16:36.440 --> 16:37.360
- Sit here.
- Not this.

16:37.440 --> 16:38.480
- You barely ate.
- Have this.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.120
- Good.
- Try this.

16:40.200 --> 16:41.040
No.

16:42.120 --> 16:44.840
This one helps circulation.

16:46.640 --> 16:49.600
This one heals bruises.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.720
This one is nice.

16:51.800 --> 16:53.760
And this is for swelling and pain.

16:53.840 --> 16:56.320
I twisted my ankle once,

16:56.400 --> 16:58.440
and it healed in seven days.

16:58.520 --> 17:01.800
According to Yangxi, there is ginseng

17:01.880 --> 17:04.080
and galangal in it.

17:04.760 --> 17:06.880
Lots of good stuff inside.

17:08.800 --> 17:09.920
Thanks for thinking of me.

17:10.000 --> 17:12.720
It's just a small injury. I'm fine.

17:12.800 --> 17:15.600
No, you're not fine.
Make sure to apply the medicine.

17:15.680 --> 17:18.200
If you can't reach your back,

17:18.280 --> 17:20.360
let Leshan help you.

17:22.680 --> 17:25.200
- Did you hear that?
- I heard that.

17:28.800 --> 17:29.760
Yang Xian,

17:29.840 --> 17:33.560
you didn't eat much at dinner.

17:33.640 --> 17:34.640
Was it not good?

17:35.240 --> 17:36.640
No, no, not at all.

17:36.720 --> 17:39.720
Well, it's your first time here.

17:39.800 --> 17:41.920
I can't let you sleep hungry.

17:42.000 --> 17:45.040
Tell me what you want.
I'll make it for you.

17:47.760 --> 17:49.600
I'd like some steamed egg custard.

17:49.680 --> 17:50.640
Isn't that too much?

17:50.720 --> 17:53.040
Not at all.

17:53.120 --> 17:56.760
My custard's smooth and silky.

17:56.840 --> 17:58.800
Even Leshan loves it.

17:59.400 --> 18:00.840
Mom.

18:00.920 --> 18:02.360
Don't listen to him.

18:02.440 --> 18:04.960
It's too late for custard.

18:05.040 --> 18:05.920
Such a hassle.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.160
None of your business.

18:09.040 --> 18:10.840
It's no trouble. I'll cook it now.

18:11.440 --> 18:12.840
It'll be ready soon.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.880
- Thanks, Madam.
- Mom.

18:22.920 --> 18:24.200
Do it.

18:33.880 --> 18:34.840
Done.

18:39.880 --> 18:40.720
My back too.

18:43.240 --> 18:44.240
Ask your servant.

18:46.080 --> 18:48.840
You're my lawfully wedded wife.
Why let someone else do it?

18:50.240 --> 18:52.080
Your mother said--

18:52.160 --> 18:53.760
Stop making a big deal out of nothing.

18:53.840 --> 18:55.640
Did you forget your forced wedding stunt?

18:55.720 --> 18:57.400
I was promised to the He family.

18:58.120 --> 18:58.960
Who's your wife?

19:03.280 --> 19:05.280
Good thing you got into my bridal sedan.

19:05.360 --> 19:07.280
Look at your four sisters.

19:07.360 --> 19:09.520
They either married
to successful young men

19:10.400 --> 19:12.360
or wealthy gentlemen known in the capital.

19:12.440 --> 19:14.920
If you'd married that loser,

19:15.640 --> 19:17.840
how could you hold your head up with them?

19:17.920 --> 19:19.880
I forced the wedding to help you.

19:19.960 --> 19:21.520
You should be thanking me.

19:23.000 --> 19:23.920
Custard?

19:24.000 --> 19:24.960
Medicine?

19:25.040 --> 19:26.560
You want me to thank you for that?

19:26.640 --> 19:28.480
You're such a shameless jerk!

19:40.800 --> 19:42.160
I have to remind you.

19:42.240 --> 19:44.200
Be careful if the Li family hears this.

19:44.280 --> 19:46.840
Lose your temper, and it's all over.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.040
Left in the carriage, right?

20:03.720 --> 20:05.240
Using this laundry stick to hit a thief

20:05.320 --> 20:07.320
is better than using a rolling pin.

20:07.400 --> 20:08.880
- Take this!
- Madam, save me!

20:10.560 --> 20:12.440
Your proud creation.

20:12.520 --> 20:13.600
You better keep it.

20:14.920 --> 20:17.200
Change is easier said than done.

20:17.280 --> 20:19.800
Kind words can't beat showing the stakes.

20:19.880 --> 20:22.600
We're not doing this to vent anger.

20:22.680 --> 20:25.080
It's to show that Yang guy.

20:25.160 --> 20:27.280
He must follow the rules
and treat his wife well.

20:27.360 --> 20:31.000
If he acts up again, a line of people
are ready to teach him a lesson.

20:32.320 --> 20:34.360
You don't even thank me for this.

20:34.440 --> 20:35.480
Why are you blaming me?

20:37.280 --> 20:40.600
Yes, yes. I appreciate your effort.
Thank you very much.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.840
I owe you one, okay?

20:43.280 --> 20:44.960
- Help!
- Stop it!

20:45.040 --> 20:46.160
Help me!

20:46.240 --> 20:47.800
- Stop! Help!
- What? What

20:47.880 --> 20:49.080
Don't run!

20:49.160 --> 20:50.280
Qiongnu.

20:50.360 --> 20:51.560
- You!
- Qiongnu.

20:52.240 --> 20:53.360
What's going on here?

20:53.440 --> 20:54.800
I've put up with you all day.

20:54.880 --> 20:56.440
If not for my mom,

20:56.520 --> 20:59.040
why would I be kind to a kidnapper?

20:59.120 --> 21:00.000
Fine, fine.

21:00.080 --> 21:01.480
Qiongnu, did you see that?

21:01.560 --> 21:03.240
- Your sister's so feisty.
- You!

21:03.320 --> 21:04.880
Couples bickering is normal.

21:04.960 --> 21:06.040
Holding that isn't right.

21:06.120 --> 21:07.320
Put it down. Okay?

21:07.400 --> 21:09.280
Why all the noise
in the middle of the night?

21:09.360 --> 21:10.400
Madam, help me!

21:10.480 --> 21:11.440
- Madam.
- Come here.

21:11.520 --> 21:12.440
- Madam.
- Leshan.

21:12.520 --> 21:13.400
What now?

21:13.480 --> 21:14.560
- Drop it.
- Shouhua's here.

21:14.640 --> 21:16.880
Leshan, the new son-in-law's here.

21:16.960 --> 21:19.240
The neighbors can hear you yelling.

21:19.320 --> 21:21.200
- You're embarrassing Mom.
- Exactly.

21:21.280 --> 21:22.920
He wants me to thank him
for kidnapping me.

21:23.000 --> 21:24.040
What a shameless thief!

21:24.640 --> 21:25.640
Nobody stop me today.

21:25.720 --> 21:26.920
If we indulge his arrogance,

21:27.000 --> 21:29.640
he'll keep bullying me forever!

21:29.720 --> 21:32.720
I won't take that from him. No way!

21:32.800 --> 21:33.640
- Mr. Du.
- Mr. Du.

21:33.720 --> 21:34.560
- Be the judge.
- You…

21:34.640 --> 21:35.840
- You're wrong.
- Come here.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.480
How could you say this?

21:37.560 --> 21:39.920
He deserves it.
Leshan, let him go for my sake.

21:40.000 --> 21:40.840
No way!

21:42.040 --> 21:43.400
Drop it!

21:44.000 --> 21:45.960
What did I do in my past life?

21:46.040 --> 21:47.040
You're a troublemaker.

21:47.120 --> 21:48.760
You've been married just a few days.

21:48.840 --> 21:50.040
You scare him with this?

21:50.120 --> 21:51.840
- I--
- Doing this for everyone to hear?

21:51.920 --> 21:53.320
Put it down!

21:53.400 --> 21:54.600
Put it down.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.720
Leshan.

21:56.280 --> 21:57.360
Madam.

21:57.880 --> 22:00.240
- That's okay.
- I can't handle this wife anymore.

22:00.320 --> 22:03.280
- I'm truly sorry this time.
- Good kid.

22:03.360 --> 22:05.560
Be patient. I'll have her change.

22:05.640 --> 22:07.600
- Okay.
- How miserable.

22:07.680 --> 22:08.520
You can't take it.

22:09.120 --> 22:11.640
Write a letter of divorce.
We're done today.

22:11.720 --> 22:12.800
- Leshan.
- Hey.

22:12.880 --> 22:14.000
- Drop it.
- Yang Xian.

22:14.080 --> 22:15.240
This kid.

22:15.760 --> 22:18.040
A royal marriage can't be dissolved.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.280
Divorce? Not a chance.

22:19.360 --> 22:20.960
- Stop it.
- Mom.

22:21.040 --> 22:22.520
I'll marry someone better.

22:22.600 --> 22:23.920
You'll die alone here.

22:24.000 --> 22:25.520
Spend your life as a lonely widow!

22:25.600 --> 22:27.520
- Calm down, Madam.
- Mom.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.640
Mom.

23:03.600 --> 23:04.920
Mom.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.680
Fine. I was wrong, okay?

23:10.480 --> 23:12.840
Wow! You admit you're wrong?

23:15.440 --> 23:16.880
You scared him half to death.

23:16.960 --> 23:19.440
I must've raised a warrior, huh?

23:19.520 --> 23:21.440
You're braver than most men.

23:21.520 --> 23:22.680
Mom.

23:23.200 --> 23:25.040
He fell on his own.

23:25.120 --> 23:26.200
It's not really my fault.

23:26.800 --> 23:28.120
Still arguing with me?

23:28.200 --> 23:30.160
Even if you didn't chase him,

23:30.800 --> 23:31.760
you still scared him.

23:31.840 --> 23:32.920
I…

23:34.880 --> 23:36.680
Shouhua.

23:41.120 --> 23:42.160
Mom.

23:42.880 --> 23:44.840
Yang Xian broke his leg.

23:44.920 --> 23:46.960
He needs someone to care of him.

23:47.040 --> 23:48.560
Let her make amends.

23:49.320 --> 23:50.520
Besides,

23:50.600 --> 23:52.080
if you really hurt her,

23:52.160 --> 23:53.960
you'd regret it yourself.

23:55.000 --> 23:57.000
Today, I'm putting my foot down.

23:57.080 --> 23:59.080
From now on, you're staying home.

23:59.680 --> 24:01.880
Focus on taking care of your husband.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.880
No one else is allowed to help.

24:03.960 --> 24:06.880
If there's even a slight mistake,

24:06.960 --> 24:08.800
you won't set foot in this house again.

24:09.400 --> 24:11.960
- Mom.
- Don't even call me mom.

24:14.360 --> 24:16.880
Mom, please calm down.

24:16.960 --> 24:19.040
I've sent Qiansheng to the Yangs.

24:19.120 --> 24:20.840
I told them you're keeping her longer.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.680
So, the couple can stay a few more days.

24:23.480 --> 24:24.720
Once his leg heals,

24:24.800 --> 24:26.840
we'll send him back.

24:26.920 --> 24:28.480
To avoid alarming the Yang family.

24:30.000 --> 24:30.960
Alright, let's go.

24:31.040 --> 24:32.480
Let's go.

24:33.920 --> 24:35.240
What a mess.

24:40.280 --> 24:43.560
- Go take care of him.
- Sure.

24:48.720 --> 24:49.920
We're off.

25:03.640 --> 25:04.640
It hurts.

25:06.280 --> 25:07.120
I'll be gentle.

25:14.120 --> 25:16.040
You're suffocating me.

25:16.120 --> 25:18.520
No, no, not at all.

25:22.160 --> 25:23.200
Be gentler.

25:23.800 --> 25:25.200
You're so clumsy.

25:38.800 --> 25:41.080
- I'm hot.
- What?

25:41.160 --> 25:42.640
I said I'm hot.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.240
Water.

25:54.160 --> 25:57.200
Anyone? I need water.

25:58.000 --> 25:58.840
Coming, coming.

25:59.560 --> 26:00.680
Here, here. Water's here.

26:03.120 --> 26:04.960
Madam! Leshan--

26:07.240 --> 26:09.640
No, nothing happened.

26:11.120 --> 26:13.720
What are you doing? Keep fanning.

26:30.440 --> 26:31.680
Chunlai.

26:31.760 --> 26:33.360
Boil the medicine longer.

26:50.160 --> 26:52.600
Chunlai, why are you taking over?

26:54.120 --> 26:55.000
Chunlai.

27:15.160 --> 27:17.000
My lord, time to drink your medicine.

27:18.600 --> 27:20.400
I know you're mad at me.

27:21.480 --> 27:24.000
But I've stayed up caring for you.

27:24.080 --> 27:25.760
Up at midnight to make your medicine.

27:26.520 --> 27:29.280
My eyes are red, fingers burned.

27:30.160 --> 27:32.000
Please, consider my effort.

27:32.080 --> 27:33.920
At least drink a little.

27:35.120 --> 27:37.040
Such care and effort,

27:37.120 --> 27:38.440
just so I'll take the medicine?

27:39.040 --> 27:40.280
Afraid your mom will scold?

27:41.560 --> 27:43.000
What's your real motive?

27:43.920 --> 27:46.320
You're misunderstanding me again.

27:47.160 --> 27:49.680
If you don't drink, your leg won't heal.

27:50.280 --> 27:52.480
It'll hurt more than just you.

27:52.560 --> 27:54.440
It'll ruin my peace too.

27:55.120 --> 27:56.600
Seeing you in pain every night,

27:57.200 --> 27:59.480
I can't bear it either.

28:01.320 --> 28:02.360
My lord.

28:24.640 --> 28:27.760
Do you know what's in this medicine?

28:31.960 --> 28:33.720
It's arsenic.

28:35.320 --> 28:36.400
In less than an hour,

28:37.640 --> 28:39.440
you'll bleed from every pore,

28:39.520 --> 28:40.520
your insides will rot.

28:40.600 --> 28:43.200
Who says I can't refuse an imperial match?

28:43.280 --> 28:44.840
I'd rather be a widow

28:44.920 --> 28:46.120
than stay married to you.

28:47.440 --> 28:48.840
You vile woman.

28:50.520 --> 28:51.640
What's wrong?

28:54.360 --> 28:56.240
- What's going on?
- Mom.

28:57.160 --> 28:58.080
- Shouhua.
- Good kid.

28:58.160 --> 29:00.400
- It's okay?
- He insists I poisoned him.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.840
He even spilled the medicine bowl.

29:02.920 --> 29:04.720
He's clearly wronging me.

29:05.640 --> 29:07.120
Kid,

29:07.200 --> 29:09.520
you've really wronged her this time.

29:10.200 --> 29:13.040
I got the medicine myself.

29:13.120 --> 29:14.760
After it was brewed,

29:14.840 --> 29:16.680
I made her taste it first,

29:16.760 --> 29:18.440
fearing bitterness.

29:18.520 --> 29:21.000
Besides, you're her husband,

29:21.080 --> 29:22.320
and this is her family home.

29:22.920 --> 29:25.960
If anything happens to you,
she'd be the first to blame.

29:26.760 --> 29:28.520
Li Leshan.

29:30.400 --> 29:31.240
Naughty girl.

29:35.600 --> 29:37.280
He's being dramatic, refusing medicine.

29:37.960 --> 29:39.040
Ignoring my intentions.

29:39.640 --> 29:40.560
If he dares next time…

29:40.640 --> 29:42.200
You little troublemaker.

29:43.640 --> 29:45.520
Mom, the Yangs sent someone to fetch them.

29:46.320 --> 29:47.840
Weren't they staying more days?

29:48.440 --> 29:49.280
Why?

29:49.360 --> 29:51.720
They said Lady Jieyu is visiting home.

29:51.800 --> 29:53.960
They rushed to escort the newlyweds back.

29:59.400 --> 30:01.080
Li Leshan,

30:01.160 --> 30:03.240
your doom is near.

30:05.800 --> 30:07.120
YANG MANSION

30:07.720 --> 30:09.320
Your sister-in-law

30:09.400 --> 30:11.720
isn't virtuous at all.

30:11.800 --> 30:14.280
She lacks grace, manners, and decorum.

30:14.360 --> 30:16.400
Other daughters-in-law

30:16.480 --> 30:18.360
respect their mothers-in-law.

30:18.440 --> 30:19.440
But her?

30:19.520 --> 30:21.440
She fears nothing.

30:21.520 --> 30:23.200
Rules and customs mean nothing to her.

30:24.000 --> 30:26.640
You won't find another
like her in Bianjing.

30:26.720 --> 30:27.800
True.

30:27.880 --> 30:30.200
She defies her mother-in-law,
bullies her husband,

30:30.280 --> 30:32.520
and is terribly fierce.

30:32.600 --> 30:36.000
I say take her to court.

30:36.800 --> 30:39.600
Let them deal with her as an example.

30:39.680 --> 30:43.160
But we care
about Lady Jieyu's reputation

30:43.240 --> 30:44.520
and our family name.

30:44.600 --> 30:46.120
That's why we endure this.

30:46.920 --> 30:48.000
Sister,

30:48.920 --> 30:50.520
is she truly this vicious?

30:51.840 --> 30:53.160
If not completely,

30:53.240 --> 30:55.920
at least mostly true.

30:56.000 --> 30:58.760
My brother is so lawless,

30:58.840 --> 30:59.880
yet he's afraid of her.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.520
It's strange.

31:02.600 --> 31:06.000
With others, he shows no mercy.

31:06.080 --> 31:07.600
But with her,

31:07.680 --> 31:09.960
he even softens his tone.

31:10.040 --> 31:12.760
Like they say, everyone meets their match.

31:13.360 --> 31:14.920
Why blame my son?

31:15.000 --> 31:18.440
Anyone facing her would be wary too.

31:18.520 --> 31:20.560
Why don't you try taking her hit?

31:21.160 --> 31:23.200
Seems she's fiercer

31:23.280 --> 31:25.560
than I heard in the palace.

31:26.520 --> 31:28.280
Enough.

31:28.360 --> 31:30.480
She rarely visits her family.

31:31.080 --> 31:32.920
You keep pestering her with complaints.

31:33.000 --> 31:36.120
It's all just trivial household matters.

31:36.720 --> 31:39.040
Aren't you worried she'll get annoyed?

31:45.040 --> 31:47.000
Don't worry. These are all my confidants.

31:50.040 --> 31:50.960
Daughter,

31:51.040 --> 31:52.800
you've always had your own mind.

31:52.880 --> 31:56.280
Since entering the palace,
you've gained His Majesty's deep favor.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.120
I shouldn't say much,

31:58.200 --> 32:01.600
but palace life changes rapidly.

32:02.200 --> 32:04.600
I can't help but worry about you.

32:05.200 --> 32:07.000
Her Majesty has no child, no favor.

32:07.080 --> 32:09.840
They say Shang's rising fast.

32:09.920 --> 32:12.600
Even her brothers gained noble titles.

32:13.440 --> 32:15.240
A mere merchant's family

32:15.320 --> 32:18.880
rose so quickly in a few years.

32:19.480 --> 32:21.120
I wish to help you,

32:21.200 --> 32:25.200
but I lack power.

32:25.280 --> 32:26.680
My rank is too low to intervene.

32:27.280 --> 32:29.280
You must plan ahead, daughter.

32:29.360 --> 32:31.600
Don't let others steal your glory.

32:36.440 --> 32:40.720
That Li came from
a low tea-seller's family.

32:41.320 --> 32:43.360
She relies on ties
to the Shen and Du families.

32:43.960 --> 32:45.800
She's become arrogant before me.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.640
Now that you're back,

32:47.720 --> 32:50.000
it's time to teach her a lesson.

32:50.080 --> 32:52.760
Don't let her bring trouble to our family,

32:52.840 --> 32:55.080
or we'll have no way to escape it.

33:01.440 --> 33:03.400
Lady Jieyu, Master,

33:03.480 --> 33:04.800
they have returned.

33:10.000 --> 33:11.120
Carry me back to my room.

33:13.000 --> 33:15.440
My lord, Lady Jieyu is calling for you.

33:16.440 --> 33:17.640
I need to go back.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.440
I don't care who it is.

33:19.520 --> 33:20.560
This…

33:22.000 --> 33:23.600
Hurry, hurry, go back.

33:23.680 --> 33:25.840
Quickly, now!

33:30.520 --> 33:33.800
My lady, Lady Jieyu is calling for you.
Don't keep the noble waiting.

33:46.840 --> 33:48.320
Greetings, Lady Jieyu.

33:51.560 --> 33:52.960
Why don't I see Xian here?

33:53.040 --> 33:55.160
I didn't report earlier to spare worry.

33:55.240 --> 33:57.920
Since you asked, I'll tell you the truth.

33:58.000 --> 33:59.920
My husband returned home with me.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.960
He drank too much at the feast.

34:02.040 --> 34:03.120
He fell down the stairs.

34:03.800 --> 34:06.040
We asked Liu, a renowned bone physician,
to see him.

34:06.640 --> 34:08.040
His injuries were swollen.

34:08.120 --> 34:09.640
Liu realigned his bones.

34:09.720 --> 34:11.280
He prescribed an ancestral remedy.

34:11.880 --> 34:14.200
One topical ointment to wash daily

34:14.280 --> 34:16.160
and an internal formula taken with wine.

34:16.240 --> 34:18.240
His skilled hands worked wonders.

34:18.320 --> 34:20.840
After three days, he improved a lot.

34:21.440 --> 34:26.680
But today's travel made him worse.

34:27.280 --> 34:28.720
I tried to convince him,

34:28.800 --> 34:31.800
Lady Jieyu is his sister.
She'll never blame him.

34:32.400 --> 34:33.920
That's why he's resting in his room.

34:34.000 --> 34:37.880
I apologize for his absence on his behalf.

34:39.760 --> 34:41.160
How could he fall for no reason?

34:41.240 --> 34:43.000
Clearly, the Li family caused this.

34:45.360 --> 34:47.800
Don't misbehave in front of Lady Jieyu.

34:48.400 --> 34:50.920
We're all family. No need for formalities.

34:51.960 --> 34:52.840
My poor son.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.800
He married such a woman.

34:54.880 --> 34:56.480
It's truly a family misfortune.

34:56.560 --> 34:57.680
Daughter,

34:57.760 --> 35:00.680
you must punish her for your brother.

35:01.520 --> 35:03.000
Please seek justice for us.

35:03.080 --> 35:05.320
Don't let this evil wife get away with it.

35:05.920 --> 35:08.520
Slap her 50 times to teach her respect.

35:09.160 --> 35:11.760
Oh no, she's going to accuse me later.

35:11.840 --> 35:14.320
I might seize that weak one
before she retaliates.

35:15.120 --> 35:16.720
There's no going back to my home.

35:16.800 --> 35:18.560
Worst case, I'll cut my hair and be a nun.

35:18.640 --> 35:20.360
Your imperial family rules everything,

35:20.440 --> 35:22.280
but not the world outside.

35:22.360 --> 35:23.480
Bring it.

35:31.440 --> 35:32.480
Open it.

35:40.160 --> 35:42.840
This golden rod is from His Majesty.

35:43.600 --> 35:44.680
It's yours now.

35:47.520 --> 35:48.400
This…

35:49.240 --> 35:51.360
Thank you, my Lady.

35:54.160 --> 35:55.360
Lady Jieyu,

35:55.440 --> 35:57.080
you're not here for justice.

35:57.160 --> 36:01.360
You're encouraging her arrogance.

36:03.160 --> 36:06.360
His Majesty mentioned promoting my father.

36:09.160 --> 36:13.680
I told him
officials should earn promotions.

36:14.280 --> 36:17.480
It can't just be
because of his favor for me.

36:17.560 --> 36:19.880
Making exceptions and asking for favors

36:19.960 --> 36:22.560
would cause criticism.

36:22.640 --> 36:25.040
This cannot happen.

36:25.640 --> 36:26.760
You…

36:28.600 --> 36:30.560
You don't care about me

36:31.160 --> 36:32.400
or our family?

36:32.480 --> 36:35.560
I care for the family.
That's why I refuse.

36:36.160 --> 36:38.680
The Yang family
already has wealth and honor.

36:38.760 --> 36:41.760
Not from the great talent
of my brother and father,

36:42.520 --> 36:45.520
but from the ladies
who married into the palace.

36:46.840 --> 36:51.600
If your fate
relies on fragile connections,

36:52.120 --> 36:54.360
how can you forget what you have

36:54.440 --> 36:55.600
and dream about more?

36:57.040 --> 36:59.080
You're accusing your own father?

36:59.160 --> 37:00.200
That's out of line.

37:00.760 --> 37:01.920
Apologize to Lady Jieyu.

37:05.120 --> 37:07.640
Forgive us, Lady Jieyu.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.160
Since ancient times,

37:15.040 --> 37:17.360
family disgrace

37:18.360 --> 37:20.680
starts with neglecting rules.

37:21.720 --> 37:23.880
Leshan, this golden rod is for you.

37:23.960 --> 37:28.040
Use it to set the Yang family straight.

37:28.120 --> 37:32.920
One day, if someone ever
commit crimes and bully others,

37:33.520 --> 37:35.000
no matter if it is your husband

37:35.080 --> 37:37.240
or your brothers-in-law,
even your parents-in-law,

37:37.320 --> 37:39.160
you have the right to discipline them.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.920
This is not only my decision.

37:45.880 --> 37:47.080
His Majesty approves.

37:57.480 --> 37:59.640
Lady Jieyu, you're so just and wise.

37:59.720 --> 38:01.560
I'm deeply grateful.

38:04.720 --> 38:05.840
Get up.

38:07.720 --> 38:12.680
GENTLE BREEZE AND PLEASANT MOON

38:17.080 --> 38:18.040
Master.

38:20.920 --> 38:22.920
But your injuries…

38:24.920 --> 38:26.160
Sure.

38:46.800 --> 38:48.960
SPRING BREEZE AND AUTUMN MOON

38:51.080 --> 38:53.440
Lady Jieyu, why don't you go in?

38:57.200 --> 38:59.760
He doesn't want to see his sister.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.640
Out of the four of us siblings,

39:02.720 --> 39:04.920
he was always closest to me.

39:05.760 --> 39:08.400
When Father sent me to the palace,
the family was overjoyed,

39:09.160 --> 39:10.440
except him.

39:11.600 --> 39:13.960
He came at night,
trying to help me escape.

39:14.880 --> 39:18.080
Father nearly broke his legs for that.

39:18.680 --> 39:20.640
He was bedridden for six months.

39:24.040 --> 39:25.040
Leshan,

39:26.400 --> 39:28.360
my brother wasn't always this way,

39:29.040 --> 39:32.440
spoiled by Mother, beaten by Father,

39:32.520 --> 39:36.680
but no one ever
taught him right from wrong.

39:39.080 --> 39:40.480
Let me ask you a favor.

39:41.600 --> 39:43.400
Guide him in the future.

39:43.480 --> 39:46.320
Don't let him go astray or get ruined.

39:48.560 --> 39:49.760
Lady Jieyu,

39:50.440 --> 39:53.880
teaching morals
is a family's responsibility.

39:55.360 --> 39:58.080
I'm just a taken woman. I wouldn't dare.

40:11.560 --> 40:13.360
If you can reform him,

40:14.240 --> 40:17.040
a year from now,
if you wish to leave the family,

40:17.800 --> 40:21.080
I'll request His Majesty personally
to grant your divorce.

40:22.600 --> 40:24.360
You mean it?

40:25.560 --> 40:28.080
Let's make a deal.

40:29.280 --> 40:30.880
Okay, deal.

40:44.560 --> 40:46.800
Since you care about him so much,

40:46.880 --> 40:48.000
why not go in and see him?

40:53.320 --> 40:55.800
Lady Jieyu, it's time to return.

41:10.880 --> 41:12.160
Li Leshan.

41:14.600 --> 41:16.080
Don't forget your promise.

41:17.520 --> 41:18.800
If you fail,

41:19.320 --> 41:21.680
you'll stay here forever.

41:29.080 --> 41:31.080
I'll leave here, no matter what.

41:34.320 --> 41:36.000
What an ungrateful girl.

41:36.080 --> 41:37.600
She's never been on my side.

41:37.680 --> 41:39.440
If she wasn't sent to the palace,

41:40.040 --> 41:41.320
she wouldn't have such glory.

41:41.400 --> 41:43.640
We worked hard for her future,

41:43.720 --> 41:45.440
but she repays us with resentment.

41:46.040 --> 41:49.080
Helping that wicked woman to bully me.

41:50.880 --> 41:53.360
Unbelievable. Absolutely unbelievable.

41:53.440 --> 41:55.720
Father shouldn't have sent her
to the palace.

41:55.800 --> 41:57.120
He should've sent me instead.

41:58.320 --> 42:00.840
She is talented in music and art,

42:01.520 --> 42:03.360
smart, poised,

42:03.960 --> 42:06.800
and favored by Her Highness.
What about you?

42:06.880 --> 42:08.320
Sister, I'm better at many things.

42:08.400 --> 42:09.360
- Enough.
- So--

42:11.360 --> 42:12.920
Instead of finding a solution,

42:13.000 --> 42:14.400
you two are having squabbles.

42:14.920 --> 42:16.160
How useless.

42:17.600 --> 42:18.440
Mom,

42:19.200 --> 42:22.400
what if she loses that rod?

42:23.080 --> 42:25.600
An imperial gift. She'd guard it fiercely.

42:25.680 --> 42:28.760
How could she lose it?

42:32.040 --> 42:35.000
Bad idea. She wouldn't fear that.

42:35.080 --> 42:37.160
But this could be serious.

42:37.240 --> 42:39.680
She could be charged
with disrespecting the royal family.

42:39.760 --> 42:41.240
It's a big deal.

42:41.320 --> 42:42.880
Once we have this against her,

42:42.960 --> 42:46.520
we control her life or death.

42:46.600 --> 42:49.920
Even a fierce tigress would bow

42:50.640 --> 42:51.760
before Mom after that.

42:57.840 --> 42:59.520
Go, bring Yinping here.

43:06.520 --> 43:08.680
Master, does it still hurt?

43:14.040 --> 43:17.360
I don't mean to meddle,

43:17.880 --> 43:19.720
but you and the lady just don't mix.

43:19.800 --> 43:21.720
Even the smallest thing causes trouble.

43:21.800 --> 43:23.680
It's better to stay away from her.

43:28.400 --> 43:29.360
Master,

43:30.600 --> 43:33.840
my brother once broke his leg.

43:34.360 --> 43:35.840
I massaged him often

43:35.920 --> 43:37.200
to make walking easier.

43:37.280 --> 43:40.560
Would you like me to help?

44:21.920 --> 44:22.760
My lady.

44:23.600 --> 44:25.640
If I see you acting like this again,

44:25.720 --> 44:27.680
I'll cut off that hand first.

44:28.840 --> 44:30.880
Qiansheng!

44:31.600 --> 44:32.560
Qiansheng.

44:33.080 --> 44:35.160
Where did everyone go?

44:37.040 --> 44:39.480
My lady, Master.

44:39.560 --> 44:41.280
Listen up, everyone.

44:42.160 --> 44:43.440
From now on,

44:43.960 --> 44:46.240
only male servants may attend here.

44:47.400 --> 44:49.360
Maids in the courtyard must obey me.

44:50.240 --> 44:51.720
No one enters here without orders.

44:52.680 --> 44:55.880
If he bothers a maid, let me know.

44:55.960 --> 44:58.160
I'll handle it.

44:58.840 --> 45:00.320
But if anyone

45:01.520 --> 45:04.520
flirts or oversteps

45:05.280 --> 45:11.960
or ever tries to lure him out for treats,

45:12.040 --> 45:15.040
bully others, and act immorally…

45:15.640 --> 45:17.880
If I hear that,

45:24.160 --> 45:25.960
I'll smash them

45:26.040 --> 45:27.960
with this golden rod.

45:32.240 --> 45:33.320
Li Haode,

45:34.320 --> 45:35.960
do you dare interfere with me?

45:36.040 --> 45:39.400
Don't tell me you're jealous too.

45:41.480 --> 45:43.680
I've always been dominant.

45:44.200 --> 45:45.680
Even my dog

45:46.720 --> 45:48.960
must only wag its tail for me.

45:49.040 --> 45:50.160
No one else is allowed.

45:51.040 --> 45:54.280
And my husband is mine to control.

45:55.000 --> 45:56.640
So, naturally,

45:56.720 --> 45:59.840
I'll watch over him closely, always.

45:59.920 --> 46:00.840
You…

46:02.960 --> 46:03.800
What?

46:07.280 --> 46:08.680
From today,

46:08.760 --> 46:11.160
you're under my care.

46:13.640 --> 46:14.600
Got a problem?

46:20.880 --> 46:21.920
Whatever.

46:32.040 --> 46:33.120
Everyone, clear?

46:34.120 --> 46:35.040
Sure.

46:53.120 --> 46:54.240
Master Jiang.

46:55.480 --> 46:56.320
Madam is calling you.

46:56.400 --> 46:59.640
Sure. I'll take my leave now.

47:21.880 --> 47:23.000
Don't take it too fast.

47:26.120 --> 47:27.360
Honey cakes are delicious.

47:27.440 --> 47:29.680
The sesame outside smells amazing.

47:29.760 --> 47:31.040
And the inside is so soft.

47:31.120 --> 47:32.400
Better than what I eat here.

47:32.480 --> 47:33.520
Of course.

47:33.600 --> 47:35.440
I made these myself.

47:35.520 --> 47:37.800
I didn't let them do it,
worried they'd overcook it.

47:37.880 --> 47:39.480
I'm glad you like it.

47:42.960 --> 47:44.200
My mother came to visit me.

47:45.000 --> 47:46.200
Even your mom left.

47:46.280 --> 47:49.080
She wants us to have some private time.

47:49.160 --> 47:50.120
Why are you here?

47:50.200 --> 47:51.320
Don't be naughty.

47:54.000 --> 47:55.840
Mom.

47:57.280 --> 47:58.520
Enough.

47:58.600 --> 48:00.040
Yang Xian, tell me.

48:00.120 --> 48:01.840
Has she treated you well?

48:01.920 --> 48:04.240
If she has been neglecting you,
I'll handle it.

48:05.520 --> 48:07.680
Mom, who is really your child?

48:09.920 --> 48:10.800
Don't worry, Madam.

48:10.880 --> 48:12.720
I'm getting better.

48:12.800 --> 48:14.600
Don't be careless.

48:14.680 --> 48:16.960
Injuries to bones take time to heal.

48:17.040 --> 48:18.760
If you don't take care,

48:18.840 --> 48:20.400
it could get worse.

48:20.480 --> 48:22.280
When you get older, it will hurt terribly.

48:24.560 --> 48:25.520
- Bone soup.
- Okay.

48:26.040 --> 48:28.080
I also made you some bone soup.

48:28.160 --> 48:30.080
Drink some.

51:02.800 --> 51:05.480
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
